<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hybridon, Isis.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hybridon, Isis.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros analyst Fariba Ghodsian said in a research note Lehman started coverage of Isis Pharmaceuticals with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $23 per share.</p>
<p>-- Isis shares rose 1-1/4 to 18-3/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Also, the firm started coverage of Hybridon Inc with venture rating, according to a research note by analyst Tony Butler.</p>
<p>-- Hybridon's price target is $15 per share.</p>
<p>-- Hybridon stock added 1/16 to 8-1/4.</p>
</text>
